<title>Cabo Delgado, Mozambique: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mozambique/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mozambique-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants killed six civilians in Nangade and forced peasant farmers to abandon fields in Cabo Delgado, limiting humanitarian access. Opposition leader Mondlane reported state abuses during a Supreme Court trial and warned that a &amp;quot;take power&amp;quot; campaign is being used to influence decisions, while denying he ordered the destruction of road toll infrastructure. The government continues to push a large LNG megaproject and DP World port expansion despite the insecurity. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE1xNkxaRW04RWpkc1RrOV9zNW1GeGVWVUlxdEVWSzlGTHJSRi13enF4S2QyOElKcktSazdzYWFmNl9Kbkh6dVpBQmVWTG44akV3NkFxUGhpVzVpTjhaaGtNbnZWZl9ZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNM0w4RF9QQkhXSFNadXNXU0tzTEZUb2JPVE0yOW44LTA4STQ4RE9ETzYtMm9zd0Y2cFhwNUVlRDdYeU40bHZpZFNTQjE3bVR3Q2xId0ZTbHNVbXdZbnVrTjY3MnlKLUdPaDVCRkNNcVZBczBNNnQ2Rl90THYxSkZCcGstMFc4RWc2Q0VOXzFjbDItMUF4M2lkanE1OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Herald.co.zw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOYXJ5V1dCRjNLRG9lUFE5RjlteFVZR1VKaE9KVGlib29MNkNYZ1lTbGNkaVRCOUl0WkFNTzJVbF9vcFYya0NzTmEzMVduYTNva01JMmVzd0ZhZ01FYVFNdjl4VkhFbEVSRUM5Y2pVYUZ1VkR6Q29MZVZra1dmekpvcmQ4MEhUNzJNdnBockh2T3hVTU1STW9Ta3FPdE5teEZHNUZVTUdBZTFZM09zSG9R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQc1FBRGgzVHNyUFJkbkFGZUxLT3Nhb2JoU29PTlFGM3JyQ1k4dE1MekZRa1NKTGl6Nm1OODljZUxLLXVSMHRmSHlGTC15RnpMeGRXTXJBdTQ5ZFNtZFk0QTVWQkdhQW5uZUNZak9BTHh4OWcxZWdwMXVxdV9MYWtYQ3lJWHV3VWlUbXhEZ01WYWRadmxZQzNKVE1BWWtmYkk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Prashant News&lt;/a&gt;, &